msgctxt "64"
msgid "Yoko! You're all right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Mom!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "I... I was so scared..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Don't you ever worry me like that again! You hear me,\r\n"
"young lady!? Never! *sob*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"We can't thank you enough. Looks like this two-bit crime syndicate was "
"abducting tourists and forcing them to work, or worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"That type of activity isn't easy to track in a town like this... It's "
"despicable how they took advantage of the people's trust here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Yeah. I hope they stay locked up for a long, long time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Ever since that \"Phantom Tour Guide\" rumor started\r\n"
"gaining momentum, the number of tourists in this area\r\n"
"has dwindled dramatically."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "That's why this syndicate started preying on local high schoolers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Talk about a couple of twisted minds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Indeed. In any case, your cooperation has been vital\r\n"
"in bringing this operation down. We really appreciate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"You don't realize how much this means to me... I just don't know what I'd "
"do without my little girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Please, take this as a token of my thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "You got <Color:8>30,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

